          </div>
          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-gray-100 flex items-center gap-2">
            <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-gray-100 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold text-gray-500">L</div>
            <span class="text-xs font-medium text-gray-400">Coordinator: <span class="text-gray-600">Dr. Lim Chee Keong</span></span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="h-full min-h-[240px] bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-8 transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out hover:border-green-400 hover:shadow-md flex flex-col justify-between cursor-pointer">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-2">
              <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 transition-colors">Database Systems Project</h4>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed line-clamp-3 mb-4">Individual project course pairing each student with a supervising lecturer to design a normalized schema and a working application.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-gray-100 flex items-center gap-2">
            <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-gray-100 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold text-gray-500">N</div>
            <span class="text-xs font-medium text-gray-400">Coordinator: <span class="text-gray-600">Dr. Priya Nair</span></span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="h-full min-h-[240px] bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-8 transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out hover:border-green-400 hover:shadow-md flex flex-col justify-between cursor-pointer">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-2">
              <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 transition-colors">Mobile App Development Capstone</h4>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed line-clamp-3 mb-4">No description available for this course.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-gray-100 flex items-center gap-2">
            <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-gray-100 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold text-gray-500">A</div>
            <span class="text-xs font-medium text-gray-400">Coordinator: <span class="text-gray-600">Dr. Ahmad Faiz Rahman</span></span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-6 flex justify-end">
      <button type="button" onclick="closeOverlay()" class="text-red-600 hover:text-red-800 text-sm font-medium">Cancel</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

